| '>The "Blue World" isn''t a song, it''s a blueprint for a digital panopticon. ' || char(10) || '>You aren''t "watching an idol." ' || char(10) || '>You are being monitored by the most successful soft-power weapon in history.' || char(10) || '>(๑╹ᆺ╹)ぬんぬん' || char(10) || '>Take your meds? No. ' || char(10) || '>Open your eyes.', 'https://media1.tenor.com/m/ZwjTtJU0SxAAAAAd/hololive-hologra.gif', '04c6d8158603', 1770727674210, 1770978844803, 0, 0);
